                <td headers="hd_h_hyper-ftc.T.genetic_disorders_to_conside_1_1_1_4 hd_h_hyper-ftc.T.genetic_disorders_to_conside_1_1_2_2 hd_h_hyper-ftc.T.genetic_disorders_to_conside_1_1_3_2" valign="middle" align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1"><list list-type="bullet"><list-item><p>Extensive medium- &#x00026; large-artery calcification in infancy resulting in cardiovascular findings</p></list-item><list-item><p>May have yellow papules in flexural body areas</p></list-item><list-item><p>Hearing loss</p></list-item></list>
