                <td headers="hd_h_hyper-ftc.T.genetic_disorders_to_conside_1_1_1_1" valign="middle" align="left" scope="row" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Arterial calcification due<break/>to CD73 deficiency<break/>(OMIM <ext-link xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" ext-link-type="uri" xlink:href="https://omim.org/entry/211800">211800</ext-link>)</td>
                <td headers="hd_h_hyper-ftc.T.genetic_disorders_to_conside_1_1_1_2" valign="middle" align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
